# Dev toolchain (Neovim + languages + CLI tools).

# --- Editor ---
neovim
tree-sitter-cli

# --- Languages (rust: rust_analyzer needs rustc for sysroot detection) ---
npm
go
rust
# nvm: .config/zsh/.zshrc sources /usr/share/nvm/init-nvm.sh to get the `nvm`
# function. The source is guarded, so a missing nvm degrades quietly to the
# system node -- but then `nvm` is not a command, which is not the intent.
nvm

# --- CLI tools (ripgrep/fd: Telescope; unzip: Mason extraction) ---
ripgrep
fd
jq
unzip
github-cli

# --- AI coding agent (config: ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json → Spark GX10) ---
opencode
